{"study_accession":"PRJNA681160","secondary_study_accession":"SRP294470","title":"RNA sequencing of ETV6-NCOA2 expression in CD34 positive cord blood cells","description":"Mixed-phenotype acute leukemia is a rare subtype of leukemia in which both myeloid and lymphoid markers are co-expressed on the same malignant cells. Their pathogenesis is largely unknown, and their treatment is challenging. We have previously discovered the specific association between recurrent t(8;12)(q13;p13) chromosomal translocation, creating ETV6-NCOA2 fusion, with T/Myeloid leukemias. Here we report that the ETV6-NCOA2 initiates T/Myeloid leukemia in preclinical models and examine the expression profile induced by ETV6-NCOA2 in CD34+ cord blood progenitors in-vitro. Overall design: Gene expression examination of ETV6-NCOA2 or empty vector in CD34 positive cord blood cells in-vitro. 3 replicates each (for each biological replicate, at least three different cord blood samples were mixed)","pubmed":"34624096","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN16934847","study_accession":"PRJNA681160","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"ETV6-NCOA2_3","description":"ETV6-NCOA2_3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4947307","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-05-19","attributes":[["source_name","Cord blood progenitor cells"],["cell_type","Cord blood progenitor cells"],["sorted cells","CD34+ cells, GFP+"],["treatment","MigR1-ETV6-NCOA2-IRES-GFP expression"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13156222","experiment_accession":"SRX9596384","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 1000","read_count":39356452,"base_count":2007179052,"first_public":"2022-05-19","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 1000 sequencing: GSM4947307: ETV6-NCOA2_3 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN16934848","study_accession":"PRJNA681160","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_f